    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Double Swing is the classic A-frame swing set, with two yellow belt seats hanging from a Horizon Teal frame. Belt seats bend to the child's shape, which many older children prefer. It suits the 6 to 12 years Key User Group and carries two. The A-frame stance takes up 8'10\" x 7'6\", and the safe play area is 10'10\" x 13'3\". It is a straightforward choice for a school ground, municipal park or society garden that wants a dependable swing. The galvanised frame carries our 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings and spare parts. Ask us for a quote and we will show the swing zone on a layout drawing."
     }
    ]
   }
